graph TD
    User([사용자]) -->|Discord/Telegram/Slack/HTTP| Channel[Channel Node]
    User -->|gRPC| Channel
    
    Channel -->|명령 전달| Agent[Agent Node]
    
    Agent <--> LLM[LLM Bridge\nOllama, OpenAI 등]
    Agent <--> Memory[Memory Manager\nRAG 기반]
    Agent --> SkillMgr[Skill Manager]
    
    SkillMgr -->|스킬 실행| Core[Core Node\nC++]
    SkillMgr -->|동적 탐색| Discovery[Discovery Node]
    
    Core <--> HW[Hardware Interface\n가드레일/속도제한]
    Core <--> Sensor[Sensor Manager]
    HW <--> Robot([실제 로봇 / Gazebo 시뮬레이터])
